id: text/parse/2364
area: text
op: JSON parse then serialize
in: str:"\"\\ud800\""
out: value: str:"\"\\ud800\""
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: JSON.parse refuses a string whose escape is a lone surrogate with SyntaxError, where the string holds that one code unit. Answered by Broiler.JS docs/roadmap/SharedLibraries.md, SJL-5.5 (the text area's record; the correspondence's row J2).
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-json.parse spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-json.stringify ref:textref@1
