id: text/raw-json/0003
area: text
op: rawJSON's property is enumerable
in: undefined
out: value: str:"rawJSON"
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: The rawJSON property of JSON.rawJSON's object is not enumerable, where CreateDataPropertyOrThrow makes it enumerable. Answered by Broiler.JS docs/roadmap/SharedLibraries.md, SJL-5.5 (the text area's record; the correspondence's row J7).
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-json.rawjson spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-json.israwjson ref:textref@1
script: Object.keys(JSON.rawJSON("1")).join()
since: 10

id: text/raw-json/0004
area: text
