since: 10

id: text/raw-json/0005
area: text
op: isRawJSON of a look-alike
in: undefined
out: value: bool:false
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: The raw-JSON brand is structural: a frozen ordinary object with a rawJSON property is taken for a raw JSON object by JSON.isRawJSON and by JSON.stringify, which writes its text unvalidated, where only JSON.rawJSON's objects carry the brand. Answered by Broiler.JS docs/roadmap/SharedLibraries.md, SJL-5.5 (the text area's record; the correspondence's row J6).
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-json.rawjson spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-json.israwjson ref:textref@1
script: JSON.isRawJSON(Object.freeze({ rawJSON: "1" }))
since: 10

